  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">字幕高亮</h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">为不同字幕添加样式以区分，同时提供对单个字幕的自定义设置。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/Yeah-Zero/Subtitle-Highlight?style=flat-square\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=Mod Loader&amp;message=Fabric | Quilt&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=flat-square\" width=\"113\" height=\"26\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>链接</h2><hr><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Yeah-Zero/Subtitle-Highlight\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/subtitle-highlight\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsubtitle-highlight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mcmod.cn%252fclass%252f8183.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCmod</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>依赖项</strong></h3><hr><p>Cloth Config（<a href=\"https://github.com/shedaniel/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>）</p><p>Fabric API（<a href=\"https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>）</p><p>Fabric Loader（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">官网</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric-loader\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>说明</strong></h3><hr><p><span style=\"color:#f00\">此模组含有令部分人感到不适的彩蛋，可以通过配置屏幕中的”iKun彩蛋“关闭。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>默认配置</strong></h3><hr><p>配置文件保存在“&lt;游戏目录&gt;\\config\\subtitle_highlight.json”。</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>● 移除延迟：3秒</p>\n<p>● 起始比例：1</p>\n<p>● 结束比例：0.29411764705882354</p>\n<p>● 背景颜色：#cc000000</p>\n<p>● 缩放：1</p>\n<p>● 底部边距：25（1.18.2及以前）或30（1.19及以后）</p>\n<p>● 侧边边距：1</p>\n<p>● 基本颜色设置</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 环境：深蓝色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 方块</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 通用：白色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 互动：水绿色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 运作：深水绿色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 危险：红色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 农作物：深绿色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 方块（其它）：深灰色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 附魔：紫色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 实体</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 生物</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 玩家</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 攻击：金色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 受伤：深红色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 玩家（其它）：白色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 被动：绿色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 中立：黄色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 敌对：红色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 头目：浅紫色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 载具：灰色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 弹射物：金色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 爆炸物：红色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 装饰品：灰色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 实体（其它）：深灰色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 物品</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 武器：金色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 防具：深绿色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 工具：蓝色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 物品（其它）：白色</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● 其它：白色</p>\n<p>● 自定义列表</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● ……</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● ……</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ● ……</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><hr><p>&nbsp;</p>",
